WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.095
The end of this map.

00:01.901 --> 00:04.781
Nearly fifty billion light-years out, this map ends.

00:05.240 --> 00:11.850
What we can see ends sooner, about 46 billion light-years away: farther light has not had time to reach us.

00:12.356 --> 00:16.126
Nothing measured lies past it, so this band is an illustration.

00:16.735 --> 00:19.428
Space goes on; our view of it does not.
